    "2119943117730447436": {
      "author": "TheICHpodcast",
      "context": "The Iced Coffee Hour comparte un clip donde Anthony Pompliano dice: «If you're just optimizing for security, probably the ETF is the single most secure thing for people to do», como la forma más segura de tener entre $10.000 y $10.000.000 en Bitcoin, en lugar de una hardware wallet.",
      "created_at": "2026-11-10T00:00:00Z",
      "created_at_chile": "2026-11-09 21:00:00 America/Santiago",
      "created_at_verified": true,
      "cta": "",
      "exclude_reason": "",
      "first_seen_at": "2026-11-10T01:18:00.259761+00:00",
      "followers_checked_at": "2026-11-10T01:18:00+00:00",
      "followers_count": 35403,
      "followers_count_verified": true,
      "followers_source": "x.get_posts_by_ids.includes.users.public_metrics.followers_count",
      "id": "2119943117730447436",
      "language": "en",
      "last_seen_at": "2026-11-10T01:18:00.259761+00:00",
      "qualification": {
        "age_seconds": 4680.26,
        "exclude_reason": "",
        "followers_checked_at": "2026-11-10T01:18:00+00:00",
        "followers_count": 35403,
        "followers_count_verified": true,
        "min_followers_exclusive": 20000,
        "qualified": true,
        "window_seconds": 7200
      },
      "qualified": true,
      "reply_blank": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119943117730447436",
      "reply_with_suggestion": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119943117730447436&text=Depends%20on%20which%20risk%20you%27re%20optimizing%20for.%20An%20ETF%20removes%20the%20risk%20of%20losing%20your%20seed%2C%20but%20adds%20custodian%20and%20broker%20risk%2C%20and%20you%20can%27t%20move%20or%20spend%20the%20coins%20yourself.%20Self-custody%20done%20carefully%20is%20a%20skill%20you%20can%20learn%2C%20not%20a%20gamble.%20I%20wrote%20a%20book%20on%20doing%20it%20air-gapped%2C%20free%20on%20Kindle%20until%20Wednesday%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2Fdp%2FB0HQ5NS31N%3FdplnkId%3Dc09ef739-11f3-4c76-8c62-92ce160a3341%26nodl%3D1",
      "source_post_id": null,
      "suggested_text": "Depends on which risk you're optimizing for. An ETF removes the risk of losing your seed, but adds custodian and broker risk, and you can't move or spend the coins yourself. Self-custody done carefully is a skill you can learn, not a gamble. I wrote a book on doing it air-gapped, free on Kindle until Wednesday: https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HQ5NS31N?dplnkId=c09ef739-11f3-4c76-8c62-92ce160a3341&nodl=1",
      "timestamp_source": "x.get_posts_by_ids",
      "topic": "custodia",
      "url": "https://x.com/TheICHpodcast/status/2119943117730447436"
    },
    "2119944063763747304": {
      "author": "AnalisaCrypto",
      "context": "Analisa Crypto Prime (en indonesio) dice que BTC rebotó desde $73.510 y prueba $75.500–$75.600 como resistencia, bajo la EMA200 diaria (~$76.800). Señala que en el rebote subió el open interest y la ratio de cuentas long en OKX sigue en ~2,8, o sea, rebote con longs nuevos y no cierre de shorts.",
      "created_at": "2026-11-10T00:03:46Z",
      "created_at_chile": "2026-11-09 21:03:46 America/Santiago",
      "created_at_verified": true,
      "cta": "",
      "exclude_reason": "",
      "first_seen_at": "2026-11-10T01:18:00.259761+00:00",
      "followers_checked_at": "2026-11-10T01:18:00+00:00",
      "followers_count": 60901,
      "followers_count_verified": true,
      "followers_source": "x.get_posts_by_ids.includes.users.public_metrics.followers_count",
      "id": "2119944063763747304",
      "language": "in",
      "last_seen_at": "2026-11-10T01:18:00.259761+00:00",
      "qualification": {
        "age_seconds": 4454.26,
        "exclude_reason": "",
        "followers_checked_at": "2026-11-10T01:18:00+00:00",
        "followers_count": 60901,
        "followers_count_verified": true,
        "min_followers_exclusive": 20000,
        "qualified": true,
        "window_seconds": 7200
      },
      "qualified": true,
      "reply_blank": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119944063763747304",
      "reply_with_suggestion": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119944063763747304&text=Poin%20open%20interest-nya%20yang%20paling%20penting%3A%20kalau%20pantulan%20ini%20diisi%20long%20baru%2C%20bukan%20short%20yang%20menutup%20posisi%2C%20resistance%20%2475.600%20jadi%20ujian%20yang%20lebih%20berat.%20Menarik%20dilihat%20apakah%20data%20inflasi%20AS%20malam%20ini%20mengubah%20komposisi%20itu.",
      "source_post_id": null,
      "suggested_text": "Poin open interest-nya yang paling penting: kalau pantulan ini diisi long baru, bukan short yang menutup posisi, resistance $75.600 jadi ujian yang lebih berat. Menarik dilihat apakah data inflasi AS malam ini mengubah komposisi itu.",
      "timestamp_source": "x.get_posts_by_ids",
      "topic": "precio-btc",
      "url": "https://x.com/AnalisaCrypto/status/2119944063763747304"
    },
