      "reply_with_suggestion": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119954508927164552&text=The%20slogan%20is%20the%20easy%20part.%20The%20harder%20question%20is%20where%20the%20keys%20actually%20live%3A%20a%20phone%20wallet%20or%20a%20device%20you%20have%20to%20trust%20can%20still%20expose%20them.%20I%20wrote%20a%20book%20on%20building%20your%20own%20air-gapped%20setup%20without%20exchanges%20or%20hardware%20vendors%2C%20free%20on%20Kindle%20until%20Wednesday%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2Fdp%2FB0HQ5NS31N%3FdplnkId%3Dc09ef739-11f3-4c76-8c62-92ce160a3341%26nodl%3D1",
      "source_post_id": null,
      "suggested_text": "The slogan is the easy part. The harder question is where the keys actually live: a phone wallet or a device you have to trust can still expose them. I wrote a book on building your own air-gapped setup without exchanges or hardware vendors, free on Kindle until Wednesday: https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HQ5NS31N?dplnkId=c09ef739-11f3-4c76-8c62-92ce160a3341&nodl=1",
