      "reply_with_suggestion": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119956018427793461&text=What%20I%20like%20here%20is%20that%20the%20level%20rises%20with%20time%20instead%20of%20being%20a%20fixed%20number.%20The%20power%20law%20gives%20a%20similar%20long-run%20view%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fforecastquant%2Fstatus%2F2118779927340470279%20Neither%20is%20a%20guarantee%2C%20but%20both%20beat%20reading%20fear%20off%20a%204h%20chart.%20How%20many%20weekly%20closes%20has%20BTC%20had%20below%20that%20band%3F",
      "source_post_id": null,
      "suggested_text": "What I like here is that the level rises with time instead of being a fixed number. The power law gives a similar long-run view: https://x.com/forecastquant/status/2118779927340470279 Neither is a guarantee, but both beat reading fear off a 4h chart. How many weekly closes has BTC had below that band?",
